/-!
# §8.3 Lemma 21: chirp identity (36) and permutation cancellation (37)

* `chirp_periodic`: `a_j = exp(-π i Σ s_i j_i²/t_i)` has period `t_i` in coordinate `i`
  (each `t_i` even).
* `lemma21_chirp` (36): `Q F_t u = ā · (a ∗ (ā · u)) / T`.
* `lemma21_cancel` (37): `R F_s⁺ ((R F_s u)·(R F_s v)) = (u ∗ v)/S²` for `t_i` units mod `s_i`.
* `conj_dftM`: conjugating input and output of `F_s` gives `F_s⁺` (also after `R`).
* `chirp_phase_numerator` (§9.5): the chirp phase is `exp(2πi N/(2r))` with
  `N = -s j² (r/t)`.
-/

